# Flashback {4}{R}{R} (CR 702.34a): Bulk Up, cast from the hand at Bot2's Llanowar Elves (1 -> 2), is in the graveyard and can be
# cast again from there for its flashback cost, doubling the power it has now (2 -> 4). Cast with flashback it is exiled as it
# leaves the stack instead of going to the graveyard. Flashback costs six: Mountain, the second Mountain, Mox Pearl and Black Lotus
# (three red). Before the flashback it is refused, as there is nothing to pay it with.

